<title>HONG KONG: RUGBY UNION-DRAW FOR SECOND DAY'S GROUP PLAY.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-DRAW FOR SECOND DAY'S GROUP PLAY.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seedings after first round of</p>
<p>World Cup Sevens rugby union tournament on Friday and draw for</p>
<p>second day's play:</p>
<p>Seedings: 1-Fiji, 2-South Africa, 3-Western Samoa, 4-France,</p>
<p>5-New Zealand, 6-England, 7-Spain, 8-Australia, 9-Scotland,</p>
<p>10-Zimbabwe, 11-Cook Islands, 12-Tonga, 13-United States,</p>
<p>14-Argentina, 15-Hong Kong, 16-Wales, 17-Namibia, 18-Ireland,</p>
<p>19-Morocco, 20-Romania, 21-Japan, 22-Canada, 23-South Korea,</p>
<p>24-Portugal</p>
<p>Draw:</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p>Fiji, Wales, Namibia</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p>South Africa, Hong Kong, Ireland</p>
<p>Pool C</p>
<p>Western Samoa, Argentina, Morocco</p>
<p>Pool D</p>
<p>France, United States, Romania</p>
<p>Pool E</p>
<p>New Zealand, Tonga, Japan</p>
<p>Pool F</p>
<p>England, Cook Islands, Canada</p>
<p>Pool G</p>
<p>Spain, Zimbabwe, South Korea</p>
<p>Pool H</p>
<p>Australia, Scotland, Portugal</p>
</text>
